{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dd4df31c-35e1-8465-8f16-f12f2ab74d3d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T11:37:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Dennis Kearney. I'm calling about a catch basin that's plugged up. It's been like that since before the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Dennis, sorry to hear that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:31:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four seventy-five Bridge Street, down the Point. It's on the corner right there. Whole thing's packed with leaves. Nobody's touched it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is it holding water right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. It's a puddle that never goes away. And I'm not talking about after a storm. We haven't had rain in days. It's dry out and the thing's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's not draining at all, even in dry weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope. Not a bit. Water just sits. Gets a skin of ice on it some mornings, then thaws, and it's right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How deep does it get? Roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. On my car, anyway. I have to park down the block now or drive through it, and I'm not doing that every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a lot of standing water. Is it in the road, or does it get up on the sidewalk too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the road, right at the corner where it dips. Spills onto the sidewalk edge a little. People are stepping around it with strollers and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And you said leaves, so you can see the grate itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Part of it. It's matted over. Brown mush, been there since fall. Honestly, it's been months. I figured somebody'd come by with a truck. Nobody did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Have you called about this one before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I kept thinking it'd get taken care of. That's the way it goes, right? You wait, nothing happens, so now I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:34:00-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm glad you did. So you asked who to call, and you've got the right place. I'll put in a work order for the crew to go clear that basin and check whether it's draining underneath, because if it's still ponding after the leaves are out, there may be a blockage in the pipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's what I figured. Leaves wouldn't make it sit that long by themselves, not that deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. They'll take a look. Let me get the cross street, so they find the right corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, it's the corner right by my place. Four seventy-five Bridge. The basin's on the corner just past my house, toward the water side. You can't miss it. Big puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:35:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Corner just past 475 Bridge, toward the water. And a good number to reach you, in case they need to confirm anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:35:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh-one-six-eight. Perfect. And that's a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:35:19-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cell. I'm outside right now, actually, standing next to it. [pause] You can hear the buoy out there at night too, you know. That bell, way out. Quiet street, so it carries. And I lie there thinking, nice, a bell and a lake in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the bell I can't fix, but the lake I can try. I'm entering it now. I'll mark it as dry-weather ponding, blocked catch basin, so it doesn't get lumped in with storm cleanup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because that's what it is. No storm. Just clogged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Crews are working through a list this time of year, so I'd say it could be a few days to a couple of weeks. If it's still sitting there after that, call me back and mention this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple weeks. Okay. It's been two months, so what's two more weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:36:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know. I'm sorry. I'll flag it so it doesn't sit. Anything else going on on your street? Other drains, potholes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:36:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, that's the one. Just that one. Everything else around here's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:36:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. You're all set, Dennis. Keep an eye on it, and if it freezes over bad, stay clear of it, those edges get slick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I know. I've been walking around it. Alright, thanks. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
